## Interface: 16001
## Title: ForeverScribe
## Notes: Read-only character journal for your AI agent: snapshot + event log in SavedVariables. No network, no automation; the only chat read is auction-outcome system lines. /scribe way sets a map pin + arrow; /fs go walks a route your agent wrote. Notes where you meet NPCs. Item tooltips show auction-house prices your agent wrote (/scribe tooltip). Tells your agent which Polestar guide step you are on (read-only). The profession window shows craft cost, sells-for and profit (/scribe craftprices).
## Author: ForeverScribe contributors
## Version: 0.8.3
## SavedVariables: ForeverScribeDB
## OptionalDeps: ForeverScribe_Live, ForeverScribe_Prices, Polestar

Util.lua
Defaults.lua
Collect.lua
Core.lua
Waypoint.lua
Npcs.lua
Route.lua
Tooltip.lua
Craft.lua
Guide.lua
